/-!
M11 is a conservative compiler extension over M10. It translates conjunctions
of multiple static type and capture members over one runtime representation
and one payload. Repeated labels share one allocated static name and retain
every interval constraint. This layer does not add general runtime records,
runtime record intersection, or full object intersection.
-/
